WEBVTT

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.040
Tala. Ndenge oyo Nzambe ya Mokolo nyonso alobi:

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:23.380
ntango nakosalisa mboka ya Isalaele na kati ya bato oyo ezali kokamwa. Nzambe azali na lolenge ya kosalisa biso.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:31.340
Liboso ya que nazali koya, lolenge moko : Yo, tambola mpo na kokanga malamu.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.200
Ntango oyo, lingá.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.360
Mibeko eza na verse ntongani na zomi-mokete elobeli :

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:42.880
komona nzela ya libanda

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.960
o na bomoi ya ekole.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:51.060
Nzala ya elikya mpe ya solo ya esengo.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:55.860
Kokanga ya bokasi mpe ya kondima.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:01:03.420
Ekomi ya kolanda na yo oyo ebomaka boyokani na Nzambe na biso.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:12.180
Nayé na ndakisa ya koyeba bosolo ya moninga na biso, makambo, elimo, valeur mpe cultural.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:16.360
Nzambe alobi : ekoki kosenga na ngai.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:20.280
oyo elendisami.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:23.580
Mpamba na kolandaka,

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:37.340
Ezali te lisanga ya bozwi, ezali te lisanga ya bampota, ezali mingi kolongona, ezali mingi santuaire ya solo. Nzoyi wana mokolo olingi kolendisa "Oh, ezali malamu",

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:40.880
Nazali koloba: Seigneur, bato oyo bakofanda na ngai.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:47.900
Ekomi na motema na ngai. Ngonga ezali koya.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:53.660
Église Impact Global ekosenga kokutana.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:58.060
Tika ná koswana-swana.

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:19.320
Motɛmɛ moko, mbongo moko, eglise moko mpo na bazo tanga biso mpenza makambo ya komituna na Kinshasa. Bato banda kolongola na esprit ya lilali ya Kinois.

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:23.280
Pona ete awa, ezali na motema yango, motema ya bilanga oyo, oyo ememeli ba politiciens,

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:30.460
oyo etindaka ba-commerçants, mpe na ekólo pe.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:55.540
Esila te mpasi. Loko okende na Kinshasa, ezali na ansu ya kolanda église Impact. Bato bazali kokanga makambo ndenge awa, ezali impact, mais ezali te impact. Loko Nzambe akokangisa biso lokola moko communauté.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:59.240
Apo, bakozala kosala biso ba ndako.

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:10.060
Tosenga oyo tozali kolanda. Bokonzi ezali kolobela likambo moko.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:14.500
Mingi culti-, mingi culture, mingi mentalité.

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:18.940
Ntango moko moke ezali mwana ya Bruxelles asangana na mwana ya Abidjan,

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.900
Esengeli te kokutana na nko ya mposo.

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:35.500
Ezali boyokani, ezali bana oyo moko. Bazalaka na komwa na robinet moko. Mbala nini bana ya Abidjan bakoki kozala na motema ya Ivoirien?

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:40.800
Na ndeseke makambo nini ba lideri bapesa libanda nsima ya kosala?

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:43.560
Oyo, ezali mandat oyo Nzambe atiyaka biso.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:55.140
Dites amen. Nga, nazali mbangu mingi na basi ya ba parents oyo bazali koloba na ba enfants na ndako ya makambo yopanzá na oyo ngai, nakoloba awa.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:59.780
Nazali na, nazali na makasi mingi, ba parent mingi basali yango.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:12.540
Nango ezali makambo ya сатана na nzela ya ebale na biso. Oyo tozali na motema ya lisanga te, motema ya libanda te, te na ndenge moko ya boyokani.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:21.620
Sakani ya minei. Tosa Nzambe Nkulu: ntango nakotaka ndako ya Isalaele na kati ya batu, mibale oyo motanga yango ekosilika.

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:31.640
Nakokanga na ye bokonzi na ngai na nkombo ya bangambo, mpe bakokota na mboka na bango oyo nalingaki koperaka na mosali na ngai Jacob.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.980
Ntango oyo, lingá.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:38.220
Mokonzi amonaki nguya ya mboka.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:43.680
Na nguya ya koyanola na initative ya Nzambe.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:51.060
Kobanda communauté na nsima ya likambo ete tozali kokangama na mposa ya kokanga yango.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:57.380
Na nguya ya Safa.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:01.100
Mokonzi moke, mokonzi ya maboko.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:12.420
Tosengaka nyonso mpenza na soleil ya bomoi. Moko doctrine. Tobakisa ba kondima five ya alliance.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:21.080
Na kosala ete banzi ya solo ebimela. Nzambe alobaki. Tondima malamu na loboko na ye.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:29.500
Nzambi azali kotonga communauté ya sika.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:33.040
Na reforme apostoliko-pastorale.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:45.720
Azali kotonga biso mpo na tokoka, tokoka, biso, biso, biso soki toli na mokano moko mpe kozwa makambo apostolico-pastoral lokola Paul abimisaki na Tite mpe Timothée. Paul abimisaki na Timothée,

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:56.700
Paul.

00:05:56.720 --> 00:06:00.340
Ndenge na ngai nde nakobimisa yo lokola nazali koyekola yango.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:08.836
Nazali kolakisa bango na mosala nyonso. Philozafi na ngai, doktrine na ngai,

00:06:08.856 --> 00:06:12.336
Eke moko ebimisaka ngai na kobongwana moke.

00:06:12.356 --> 00:06:17.076
Ntango yo, ozali kobanda, kobanda, kobanda kokóka na yango,

00:06:17.096 --> 00:06:20.435
Oyo ozali kotinda biso.

00:06:20.455 --> 00:06:24.376
Tozopona mpasi ya kolanda lopango ya Nzambe.

00:06:24.396 --> 00:06:28.836
Ntango Nzambe akokende kosala biso wana mboka.

00:06:28.856 --> 00:06:47.436
pona ntango tokozala elongo na nyonso oyo babongaka ye, na ntango yango basango bazalaki na esika ya boyokani, ya komitungisa, ya kobanda na nzela moko mpe ya koyembelela elongo.

00:06:47.456 --> 00:06:51.716
Bato ya mboka bakomonisa te ette bambo baye bakanisi yango.

00:06:51.736 --> 00:06:57.596
Nzamba yé nyonso ezali. Esaleli na bango nyonso oyo basala yango.

00:06:57.616 --> 00:07:03.756
Ekozala na ngai te soki bazali na baye ba combatants na monoko eza ya kitoko ya ndenge na ndenge.

00:07:03.776 --> 00:07:12.196
Bato oyo bayekoli, ata oyo batyami wana, ntango totya ngenga, moko na moko azali na boyokani na ye, comportement na ye.

00:07:12.216 --> 00:07:19.536
Mais oyo babesengi maboko ya mikolo bazali kosangisa. Alleluia.

00:07:19.556 --> 00:07:24.956
Ntango tolingi, esengo ya ba dokitani ezwaki na ntango moko.

00:07:24.976 --> 00:07:29.936
Tozali na litomba ya kozala moko officiant to prédicateur.

00:07:29.956 --> 00:07:45.896
Ntango ozali koloba awa, ezali bato balongolaka mikanda. Ekozala mobele ya komonisa ete tozali kolongolama. Ngai nazali komona yango nyonso ?

00:07:45.916 --> 00:07:55.696
Tozali na nsango - Tozali na nsango, tozali na nsango apostolique to pastoral. Mbala nini bazali kotanga doctrine apostolique soki oza moko na kati ya bayebisi?

00:07:55.716 --> 00:08:05.896
[chante]
